onFraction name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-09-30_us-gaap_WarrantMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">245,192</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span>&#160;shares exercisable under warrants were excluded
