of amounts from RM into U.S. dollars has been made at the following exchange rates</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;&#160;<span id="xdx_8BE_z2fyjLK4X2L5" style="display: none">Schedule
of Exchange Rates</span></span></p>

