<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">On
May 10, 2023, the virtual reality and augmented reality development project was completed and put it in use. The total payment to IT
firm was&#160;<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--PaymentsForSoftware_uMalaysiaRinggit_c20230510__20230510_zj9ZBQHPLuSk" title="Prepaid expense current and noncurrent"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsForSoftware" contextRef="From2023-05-102023-05-10" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="MalaysiaRinggit">11,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;Malyaia Ringgit ($<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--PaymentsForSoftware_c20230510__20230510_z3xxy07OCkvh" title="Payment to IT firm"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsForSoftware" contextRef="From2023-05-102023-05-10" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">2,343,517</ix:nonFraction></span>) and was recorded as intangible asset.</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;(see
Note 8)</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

