<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
July 3, 2023, the Company entered into an IT consulting service agreement with three consultants for analyzing the Company&#8217;s IT
infrastructure and system effective on July 3, 2023 for&#160;<span id="xdx_904_ecustom--ConsultingAgreementTerm_dc_c20230703__20230703__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember_zXhBS0mPyzdd" title="Consulting agreement term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-07-032023-07-03_custom_ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="NVFY:ConsultingAgreementTerm">twelve months</ix:nonNumeric></span>. <span style="background-color: white">The Company agreed
to grant the consultant&#160;<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices_c20221116__20221116__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember_zpn1COqiCffa" title="Number of shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2022-11-162022-11-16_custom_ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">300,000</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock, vesting&#160;<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20230703__20230703__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember_zt8MltSOtyo8" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2023-07-032023-07-03_custom_ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on July 3, 2023,&#160;<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20231003__20231003__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_z3Y6tSkfjM56" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2023-10-032023-10-03_custom_ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on October
3, 2023,&#160;<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20240103__20240104__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember__srt--StatementScenarioAxis__srt--ScenarioForecastMember_z08YRod66U6e" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2024-01-032024-01-04_custom_ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember_srt_ScenarioForecastMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on January 3, 2024 and&#160;<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20240403__20240403__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember__srt--StatementScenarioAxis__srt--ScenarioForecastMember_zywr3ulvt4k7" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2024-04-032024-04-03_custom_ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember_srt_ScenarioForecastMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on April 3, 2024. The fair value of the&#160;<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices_c20230703__20230703__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember_zYW5a6vlyEp4" title="Stock issued to consultants, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2023-07-032023-07-03_custom_ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">300,000</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;shares was $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueIssuedForServices_c20230703__20230703__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember_zr9shidtZish" title="Stock issued to consultants"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueIssuedForServices" contextRef="From2023-07-032023-07-03_custom_ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">636,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, which
was calculated based on the stock price of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--SharePrice_iI_c20230703__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember_zrpCe45Vhtw7" title="Share price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2023-07-03_custom_ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">2.12</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;per share on July 3, 2023. The shares were issued pursuant to the 2021 Plan. During
the nine and three months ended September 30, 2023, the Company charged $<span id="xdx_909_ecustom--ConsultingExpense_c20230101__20230930__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember_zmXDD5kzlbdc" title="Consulting expense amount"><span id="xdx_901_ecustom--ConsultingExpense_c20230701__20230930__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember_zXwpfLiOSoge" title="Consulting expense"><ix:nonFraction name="NVFY:ConsultingExpense" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-09-30_custom_ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="NVFY:ConsultingExpense" contextRef="From2023-07-012023-09-30_custom_ITConsultingServiceAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">159,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span>&#160;to operations as consulting expenses.</span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white"><b><i>Shares
and Options Issued to Independent Directors</i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
November 7, 2018 (the &#8220;Grant Date&#8221;), the Company entered into stock option agreements under the 2014 Omnibus Long-Term Incentive
Plan with the three independent members of the board of directors. The Company agreed to grant the Company&#8217;s three independent
directors&#8217; options to purchase an aggregate of&#160;<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_c20181106__20181107__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zPzAx7HLXP4d" title="Options to purchase shares of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2018-11-062018-11-07_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">12,000</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock at an exercise price
of $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice_pid_c20181106__20181107__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_z5ZQliNvqI93" title="Exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" contextRef="From2018-11-062018-11-07_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">29.50</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;per shares, with a term of&#160;<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod_dtY_c20181106__20181107__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zj62LVUuDfxa" title="Options term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2018-11-062018-11-07_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod">5</ix:nonNumeric></span>&#160;years. Twenty-five percent (<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20181127__20181130__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zKe5061lc995" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2018-11-272018-11-30_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>%) of those stock options vested on November 30,
2018,&#160;<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20190225__20190228__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zlAKAYveMc3i" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2019-02-252019-02-28_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on will vest on February 28, 2019,&#160;<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20190527__20190531__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_z7r4byuCSBFg" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2019-05-272019-05-31_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on May 31, 2019, and the remaining&#160;<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20190827__20190831__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zgmOGV5pUtTg" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2019-08-272019-08-31_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% will vest on August 31, 2019.
The fair value of the stock options granted is estimated on the date of the grant using the Black-Scholes option pricing model (&#8220;BSOPM&#8221;)
as described above. The fair value of the options was calculated using the following assumptions: estimated life of&#160;<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1_pid_dc_uPure_c20181106__20181107__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zxarwA33Rtld"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2018-11-062018-11-07_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1">ten years</ix:nonNumeric></span>, volatility
of&#160;<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate_pid_dp_uPure_c20181106__20181107__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_z6IPBpzPbgXe" title="Expected volatility rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" contextRef="From2018-11-062018-11-07_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">84</ix:nonFraction></span>%, risk free interest rate of&#160;<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate_pid_dp_uPure_c20181106__20181107__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zmHSFvuPTM72" title="Risk free interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate" contextRef="From2018-11-062018-11-07_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.07</ix:nonFraction></span>%, and dividend yield of&#160;<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedDividendRate_pid_dp_uPure_c20181106__20181107__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zOvfWUVUw4Zc" title="Expected dividend rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedDividendRate" contextRef="From2018-11-062018-11-07_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">0</ix:nonFraction></span>%. The fair value of&#160;<span id="xdx_90D_ecustom--FairValueOfStockOptionsShares_c20181106__20181107__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zx5jOKUNFjia" title="Fair value of stock options, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="NVFY:FairValueOfStockOptionsShares" contextRef="From2018-11-062018-11-07_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">60,000</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;stock options was
$<span id="xdx_908_ecustom--OptionGrantDateFairValue_c20181106__20181107__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zpqqYbZLajg" title="Grant date fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="NVFY:OptionGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="From2018-11-062018-11-07_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">240,105</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;at the grant date.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">On
November 4, 2019, the Company entered into stock option agreements under the 2014 Omnibus Long-Term Incentive Plan with the three independent
members of the board of directors. The Company agreed to grant the Company&#8217;s three independent directors options to purchase an
aggregate of&#160;<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_c20191103__20191104__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zOdtH6bqXgt4" title="Options to purchase shares of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2019-11-032019-11-04_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">12,000</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock at an exercise price of $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice_c20191103__20191104__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zlssjK04hgza" title="Exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" contextRef="From2019-11-032019-11-04_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">14.00</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;per share, with a term of&#160;<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod_dtY_c20191103__20191104__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zOWf5evcqGY4" title="Options term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2019-11-032019-11-04_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod">5</ix:nonNumeric></span>&#160;years,
vesting&#160;<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20191127__20191130__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zqs5GIAFgqca" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2019-11-272019-11-30_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on November 30, 2019,&#160;<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20200225__20200228__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zKvHA2XMkn5g" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2020-02-252020-02-28_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on February 28, 2020,&#160;<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20200527__20200531__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zf95Nc8C5jgh" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2020-05-272020-05-31_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on May 31, 2020, and&#160;<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20200827__20200831__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zSePeyaCHj9d" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2020-08-272020-08-31_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on August 31, 2020. The
fair value of the stock options granted was estimated on the date of the grant using the Black-Scholes option pricing model. The fair
value of the options was calculated using the following assumptions: estimated life of <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1_pid_dc_uPure_c20191103__20191104__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zRpWpz5PpIDc"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2019-11-032019-11-04_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1">ten years</ix:nonNumeric></span>, volatility of&#160;<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate_pid_dp_uPure_c20191103__20191104__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zZXgFPZ42MD2" title="Expected volatility rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" contextRef="From2019-11-032019-11-04_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">87</ix:nonFraction></span>%, risk free interest
rate of&#160;<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate_pid_dp_uPure_c20191103__20191104__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zYzlY9RXeVI7" title="Risk free interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate" contextRef="From2019-11-032019-11-04_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">1.60</ix:nonFraction></span>%, and dividend yield of&#160;<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedDividendRate_pid_dp_uPure_c20191103__20191104__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zSnm8e696Hb5" title="Expected dividend rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedDividendRate" contextRef="From2019-11-032019-11-04_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">0</ix:nonFraction></span>%. The fair value of the&#160;<span id="xdx_90D_ecustom--FairValueOfStockOptionsShares_c20191103__20191104__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zVh3kHCkOUFl" title="Fair value of stock options, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="NVFY:FairValueOfStockOptionsShares" contextRef="From2019-11-032019-11-04_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">12,000</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;stock options was $<span id="xdx_900_ecustom--OptionGrantDateFairValue_c20191103__20191104__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember_zSvMf1KlZnM" title="Grant date fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="NVFY:OptionGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="From2019-11-032019-11-04_custom_OmnibusLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">114,740</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span>at the grant
date.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white"><b><i>Shares
Issued to Employees</i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">On
November 11, 2021, the Company extended an employment agreement with the Company&#8217;s Corporate Secretary for a term of one year effective
from November 14, 2021. The Company agreed to grant an award of&#160;<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20211109__20211111__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zZCJOypNWYKj" title="Restricted stock units granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2021-11-092021-11-11_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,200</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span>restricted Stock Units to the officer pursuant to the&#160;</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Company&#8217;s&#160;<span style="background-color: white">2021
Omnibus Equity Plan. The fair value of these shares was $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20211109__20211111__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zVaizNehVF6b" title="Fair value of restricted stock units granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2021-11-092021-11-11_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">13,200</ix:nonFraction></span>, which was calculated based on the stock price of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--SharePrice_iI_c20211111__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zqmTXhCNl17c" title="Share price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2021-11-11_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">11.00</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span>per share
on November 11, 2021, the date the award was determined by the Compensation Committee of the Board of Directors, vesting&#160;<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20211110__20211110__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zGuYr6Kw1M81" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2021-11-102021-11-10_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on
November 10, 2021,&#160;<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20220331__20220331__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zvqzWRrLRHHl" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2022-03-312022-03-31_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on March 31, 2022,&#160;<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20220630__20220630__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zsE7iGe4OOje" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2022-06-302022-06-30_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on June 30, 2022 and&#160;<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20220930__20220930__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zgHU6XgluAhd" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2022-09-302022-09-30_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on September 30, 2022. During the nine and three
months ended September 30, 2022, the Company amortized $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_c20220101__20220930__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zYRGwWJTvVb5" title="Stock compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-09-30_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">9,900</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span>and $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_c20220701__20220930__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zbS2Kw4cW7J8"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2022-07-012022-09-30_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">3,300</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;to operations as stock compensation expense.</span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">On
November 11, 2022, the Company extended an employment agreement with the Company&#8217;s Corporate Secretary for a term of one year effective
from November 14, 2022. The Company agreed to grant an award of <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20221109__20221111__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zPacYdRvyeS6" title="Restricted stock units granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2022-11-092022-11-11_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,200</ix:nonFraction></span> restricted Stock Units to the officer pursuant to the </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Company&#8217;s
<span style="background-color: white">2021 Omnibus Equity Plan. The fair value of these shares was $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross_c20221109__20221111__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zHgOLlGqpM2g" title="Fair value of restricted stock units granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" contextRef="From2022-11-092022-11-11_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">3,540</ix:nonFraction></span>, which was calculated based
on the stock price of $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--SharePrice_iI_c20221111__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zu0HYZqp1Vei" title="Share price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2022-11-11_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">2.95</ix:nonFraction></span> per share on November 11, 2022, the date the award was determined by the Compensation Committee of the Board
of Directors, vesting <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20221110__20221110__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zNKJRB8gaK5i" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2022-11-102022-11-10_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on November 11, 2022, <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20230331__20230331__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zulROp2a9ik4" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2023-03-312023-03-31_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on March 31, 2023, <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20230628__20230630__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zXxQp7wdtrYg" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2023-06-282023-06-30_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on June 30, 2023 and <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20230928__20230930__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zTYhOSMaU3k2" title="Vesting rights percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2023-09-282023-09-30_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% on September 30, 2023. During the nine and
three months September 30, 2023, the Company record $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_c20230101__20230930__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zhKaPJQFJeZ9" title="Allocated share based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-09-30_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">2,655</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span>and $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_c20230701__20230930__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--EmployementAgreementMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember_zaZbTTPDtxL8" title="Stock compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2023-07-012023-09-30_custom_EmployementAgreementMember_custom_TwoThousandTwentyOneOmnibusEquityPlanMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">885</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;to operations as stock compensation expense.</span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: left">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white"><b><i>Options
Issued to Employees</i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">On
August 24, 2018, the compensation committee of the Board approved an option grant to the Company&#8217;s Chief Financial Officer to purchase
an aggregate of <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_c20180823__20180824__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_zkOUhIPOUXDf" title="Options granted to purchase common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2018-08-232018-08-24_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,400</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock at an exercise price of $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice_c20180823__20180824__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_zHkyl0Ewnct5" title="Weighted average exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" contextRef="From2018-08-232018-08-24_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">46.25</ix:nonFraction></span> per sha</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">re,
with a term of <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod_dtY_c20180823__20180824__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_zs21kgVgWC16" title="Option term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2018-08-232018-08-24_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod">5</ix:nonNumeric></span> years, <span style="background-color: white">pursuant to the Company&#8217;s 2014 Omnibus Long-Term Incentive Plan.
Fifty percent (<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20180823__20180824__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_zupAN3rwdLRj" title="Stock options vested"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2018-08-232018-08-24_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">50</ix:nonFraction></span>%) of those stock options vested immediately, and the remaining <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20180823__20180824__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefFinancialOfficerMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SixMonthAnniversaryMember_zn2ZObgHXtA6" title="Stock options vested remaining"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2018-08-232018-08-24_srt_ChiefFinancialOfficerMember_custom_SixMonthAnniversaryMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">50</ix:nonFraction></span>% vested on the six-month anniversary of the grant
date.</span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: left">&#160;</p>



